/*
  DaGoofMan theme - a dark crowned fortress and its fleet over a fiery planet
  (res/images/dagoofman.jpg), for DaGoofMan, who made the wallet's Export
  icon. His colour is orange: orange frames, buttons and title tabs, with
  ember gold amounts.

  The layout is res/flapxcoin.qss, below its variables; the base colours come
  from the theme table in guiutil.cpp.
*/

